    "title": "WGXA to go off the air overnight for scheduled maintenance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WGXA Staff ,\n1 days ago WGXA will be temporarily off the air overnight due to scheduled transmitter maintenance. The station will be off the air beginning at 12:00 a.m. Wednesday and is expected to return by 4:00 a.m. During this time, viewers who watch WGXA over the air using an antenna and some satellite users may temporarily lose the signal. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
